      "created_at": "2018-05-11T17:48:06Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-05-11T17:48:24Z",
      "body": "Here are a few terms used to describe data that customers might want to encrypt at rest:\r\n\r\n- Personal information, more often used in the context of US law, which includes:\r\n    - Personally identifiable information (PII)\r\n    - Sensitive personal information (SPI)\r\n- Personal data, more often used in the next of the GDPR",
      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "pin": null,
      "reactions": {
