      "created_at": "2018-06-25T20:51:21Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-06-25T20:51:21Z",
      "body": "We defer Key management:\r\n\r\n> Admins will be able to have different encryption keys per app/form. In the first implementation of this feature, keys will be stored in properties. In the future, we could support using keys from other sources, like a Java key store, or keys retrieved by calling the implementation of an API we provide, e.g. allowing Orbeon Forms to be integrated with a hardware key store.\r\n\r\nSee also #3631.",
      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
